      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BABY FACE BANDIT (5) has a strong record this track and trip with five wins and four placings from 14 starts. Missed the frame latest (30.02) when fourth over 520m at this track in a NG. Expected to be in the finish. VOILA (1) has been a little hard to follow, missing the frame last time but was a Grade 5 winner three starts ago and returns to Wentworth Park where he tends to run well. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Can feature with the right run. BENTLEY RED (3) has a strong record this track and trip including two wins from four starts. Was out of the placings last time (30.49) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing sixth and beaten 6 lengths. Looks one of the chances. ZIPPING MILANO (8) is a last-start placegetter with solid claims again.",
